{%- macro dl(rows) -%}{%- for n in rows -%}{{ as_datetime(n.date).strftime('%-d %b') }}{{ ', ' if not loop.last else '' }}{%- endfor -%}{%- endmacro %}
{%- set ns = namespace(now={}) %}{% for f in F %}{% set s = states(ids[f]) %}{% set ns.now = dict(ns.now.items() | list + [(f, (s | float) if is_number(s) else none)]) %}{% endfor %}
- Today so far: {% for f in F %}{{ f }} {{ ns.now[f] | round(2 if f == 'paid' else 1) if ns.now[f] is number else 'not available' }}{{ ', ' if not loop.last else '' }}{% endfor %}
{%- set y = (td - timedelta(days=1)).isoformat() %}{% set yr = days | selectattr('date','eq',y) | list %}
- Yesterday ({{ (td - timedelta(days=1)).strftime('%a %-d %b') }}): {% if yr | count %}{{ fmt(yr, none) }}{% elif y >= start %}not recorded{% else %}not recorded (the record started on 17 October 2026){% endif %}
{%- set wk = days | selectattr('date','ge',mon.isoformat()) | selectattr('date','lt',td.isoformat()) | list %}
- This week (Mon {{ mon.strftime('%-d %b') }} to now): {{ wk | count }} of {{ td.weekday() }} completed day(s) recorded, plus today so far. Totals: {{ fmt(wk, ns.now) }}
{%- set lw = days | selectattr('date','ge',lmon.isoformat()) | selectattr('date','lt',mon.isoformat()) | list %}
- Last week (Mon {{ lmon.strftime('%-d %b') }} to Sun {{ (mon - timedelta(days=1)).strftime('%-d %b') }}): {% if lw | count == 7 %}all 7 days recorded. Totals: {{ fmt(lw, none) }}{% elif lw | count %}only {{ lw | count }} of 7 days recorded ({{ 7 - lw | count }} missing). Totals of the recorded days only: {{ fmt(lw, none) }}{% elif (mon - timedelta(days=1)).isoformat() >= start %}not recorded{% else %}not recorded (the record started on 17 October 2026){% endif %}
{%- set rec = (days | sort(attribute='date', reverse=true))[:7] %}
- Recorded days (newest first; the record started 17 October 2026): {% if rec | count %}{% for r in rec %}{{ as_datetime(r.date).strftime('%a %-d %b') }}: {{ fmt([r], none) }}{{ '; ' if not loop.last else '' }}{% endfor %}{% else %}no completed day yet (today is "so far" above){% endif %}
- Total of those recorded days ({{ rec | count }} day(s)): {% if rec | count %}{{ fmt(rec, none) }}{% else %}none yet{% endif %}
{%- set nights = state_attr('sensor.example_32','nights') %}{% set nights = nights if (nights is list and state_attr('sensor.example_32','month') == now().strftime('%Y-%m')) else [] %}
{%- set before2001 = now().hour < 20 or (now().hour == 20 and now().minute < 1) %}
{%- set pend = nights | selectattr('date','eq',td.isoformat()) | selectattr('result','eq','no data') | list if before2001 else [] %}
{%- set counted = nights | rejectattr('date','in', pend | map(attribute='date') | list) | list %}
{%- set met = counted | selectattr('result','eq','met') | list %}{% set missed = counted | selectattr('result','eq','missed') | list %}{% set nod = counted | selectattr('result','eq','no data') | list %}
- Evening credit this month (an indicator from Home Assistant's own meter; the bill decides): {% if counted | count %}{{ met | count }} of {{ counted | count }} nights met (about ${{ met | count }}){% if missed | count %}; missed: {{ dl(missed) }}{% endif %}{% if nod | count %}; no data: {{ dl(nod) }}{% endif %}{% if pend | count %}; tonight: pending{% endif %}{% elif pend | count %}no nights finished yet; tonight: pending{% else %}no nights recorded yet (the record starts on 18 October 2026){% endif %}